  <AltText>
    Sprite sheet of our headmate, Wamo. She has slightly tanned skin, purple hair, two fox ears that are rounded at the tips, purple eyes, and is wearing a blue dress. They are facing, in order from top to bottom: down (towards the viewer), stage right (left from the viewer's perspective), stage left (right from the viewer's perspective), and up (with fox back towards the viewer).
